WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:02,360
Finished asking

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:04,060
After asking, let her go

3
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:05,260
Otherwise, what else do you want?

4
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:07,580
Will you keep her here to eat? Will you pay for the meal?

5
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:09,500
She and Jiang

6
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:15,020
As expected, we are in the same group. Let's go together, Chen Yundong.

7
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:16,620
Don't be too happy too early

8
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:20,540
I'll find the car keys for evidence

9
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:22,740
Where do you take it from your office?

10
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:31,540
Should we go back to work or go home and find a flower shop? Where to go to the cemetery?

11
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:41,580
Which cemetery is your mother buried in? Yunshan Cemetery. What are you doing?

12
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,540
The grave of my elder is also there

13
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:51,100
Let’s go to Yunshan Cemetery. Where is your mother’s cemetery? Now that we’re here

14
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:54,600
I have to visit your mother. Thank you.

15
00:00:57,890 --> 00:01:09,370
This is my mother, this is my father Chen Yundong

16
00:01:10,180 --> 00:01:11,700
If you didn't save me at that time

17
00:01:11,900 --> 00:01:12,980
Get to the hospital earlier

18
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:14,500
Is there still aunt?

19
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:17,480
Li Xin told her

20
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:19,460
She made a special trip to see my mother

21
00:01:22,340 --> 00:01:32,670
No, I'm not cold. It's covered. It's windy on the mountain. Can I have a cigarette? You can do it.

22
00:01:33,030 --> 00:01:33,990
But don't smoke too much

23
00:01:34,310 --> 00:01:36,670
Smoking is always bad for your health. Thank you.

24
00:01:44,740 --> 00:01:47,260
My mother's death had nothing to do with you, you don't have to blame yourself

25
00:01:49,310 --> 00:01:50,670
Even if I chose not to save you at that time

26
00:01:50,670 --> 00:01:51,790
Instead, go back to the hospital directly

27
00:01:52,270 --> 00:01:55,030
In fact, my mother is also helpless. What about you?
